  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Driver as Lái xe\n    participant UI as Document Screens\n    participant Picker as Camera/Gallery\n    participant Scan as DocumentScanService\n    participant Pre as Image Preprocessor\n    participant ML as ML Kit Text Recognizer\n    participant Viet as VietOCR ONNX Android\n    participant Extract as DocumentFieldExtractor\n    participant Local as SQLite + App Documents\n    participant Export as DrivingLogExportService\n    participant Share as Native Share Sheet\n    participant API as Document OCR API\n    participant ServerAI as Python OCR Service\n\n    Driver-&gt;&gt;UI: Chọn chụp hoặc thư viện\n    UI-&gt;&gt;Picker: pickImage(camera/gallery)\n    Picker--&gt;&gt;UI: sourcePath\n    UI-&gt;&gt;Scan: process(sourcePath, driver, plate)\n    Scan-&gt;&gt;Pre: compute preprocessDocument(bytes)\n    Pre-&gt;&gt;Pre: Detect paper, warp, quality metrics\n    Pre--&gt;&gt;Scan: originalBytes, scanBytes, score, issues\n    Scan-&gt;&gt;ML: OCR 0/90/180/270\n    ML--&gt;&gt;Scan: Best orientation + bounding boxes\n    Scan-&gt;&gt;ML: OCR date/project/header focused regions\n    ML--&gt;&gt;Scan: Focused snapshots\n    opt VietOCR native khả dụng\n        Scan-&gt;&gt;Viet: recognizeLine(project/address crops)\n        Viet--&gt;&gt;Scan: Vietnamese text\n    end\n    Scan-&gt;&gt;Extract: extract(all snapshots)\n    Extract--&gt;&gt;Scan: Fields + confidences\n    Scan-&gt;&gt;Local: Lưu original và scanned image\n    Scan--&gt;&gt;UI: DrivingLogEntry draft\n    UI--&gt;&gt;Driver: So sánh ảnh và các trường\n\n    alt Chất lượng RED\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Driver: Bắt chụp lại, không cho lưu\n    else YELLOW/GREEN\n        Driver-&gt;&gt;UI: Sửa/bổ sung và xác nhận\n        UI-&gt;&gt;Local: INSERT/REPLACE driving_log_entries\n    end\n\n    Driver-&gt;&gt;UI: Xuất tháng\n    UI-&gt;&gt;Local: Query phiếu đủ trường vận hành\n    Local--&gt;&gt;Export: List DrivingLogEntry\n    Export-&gt;&gt;Export: Build XLSX ZIP/XML offline\n    Export-&gt;&gt;Local: Ghi file và mark EXPORTED\n    Export-&gt;&gt;Share: Mở native share\n\n    opt Nhánh server đã có service nhưng chưa nối vào UI chính\n        UI-&gt;&gt;API: Multipart image\n        API-&gt;&gt;ServerAI: POST /ocr/driving-log\n        ServerAI--&gt;&gt;API: project_address, engine, elapsed_ms\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: ServerDocumentOcrResult\n    end&quot;,
  &quot;config&quot;: null
}" id="Ms-hnzfm6h4ZKQHyczgC-1"><mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" /></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="Lái xe" mermaidId="n:Driver" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;elbowEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;elbow&quot;:&quot;vertical&quot;,&quot;curved&quot;:0,&quot;rounded&quot;:0};lifelineDashed=0;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;lifelineColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);participant=seqActorStick;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;spacingBottom=4;size=90;lifelineMirror=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ECECFF,#1f2020);strokeColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" mermaidBaseValue="Lái xe" id="Ms-hnzfm6h4ZKQHyczgC-2"><mxCell parent="Ms-hnzfm6h4ZKQHyczgC-1" style="html=1;shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;elbowEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;elbow&quot;:&quot;vertical&quot;,&quot;curved&quot;:0,&quot;rounded&quot;:0};lifelineDashed=0;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;lifelineColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);participant=seqActorStick;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;spacingBottom=4;size=90;lifelineMirror=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ECECFF,#1f2020);strokeColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="1925" width="150" x="30" y="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="Document Screens" mermaidId="n:UI" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerime