wRmhH2-1" source="XPFAdUA6UGZr_IwRmhH2-3" style="endArrow=block;endSize=9;verticalAlign=bottom;edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;elbow=vertical;curved=0;rounded=0;fontSize=16;labelBackgroundColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" target="XPFAdUA6UGZr_IwRmhH2-4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="636" y="1315" /></Array><mxPoint x="432" y="1315" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="839" y="1315" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell></UserObject><mxCell id="XPFAdUA6UGZr_IwRmhH2-59" parent="XPFAdUA6UGZr_IwRmhH2-1" style="ellipse;aspect=fixed;fillColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#333333);fontSize=12;" value="20" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="20" width="20" x="422" y="1305" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Class - Tổng thể: Kiến trúc phân tầng hệ thống (Mobile - Web - Backend - AI)" id="ssLsvfWLh2l-ZIubhVNX">
    
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="2336" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><UserObject label="" mermaidData="{
  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;classDiagram\n    class DriverActor {\n        &lt;&lt;actor&gt;&gt;\n    }\n    class ManagerActor {\n        &lt;&lt;actor&gt;&gt;\n    }\n    class FlutterPresentation {\n        &lt;&lt;frontend&gt;&gt;\n        +screens()\n        +riverpodState()\n    }\n    class NextJsPresentation {\n        &lt;&lt;frontend&gt;&gt;\n        +pages()\n        +contexts()\n        +mapLibreUI()\n    }\n    class ApiClient {\n        &lt;&lt;mobile network&gt;&gt;\n        +login()\n        +get()\n        +post()\n        +patch()\n        +refreshToken()\n    }\n    class SafeFleetApi {\n        &lt;&lt;web adapter&gt;&gt;\n        +auth()\n        +fleet()\n        +trips()\n        +alerts()\n        +incidents()\n    }\n    class SpringControllers {\n        &lt;&lt;REST/WebSocket boundary&gt;&gt;\n    }\n    class DomainServices {\n        &lt;&lt;application layer&gt;&gt;\n    }\n    class JpaRepositories {\n        &lt;&lt;persistence ports&gt;&gt;\n    }\n    class DomainEntities {\n        &lt;&lt;domain model&gt;&gt;\n    }\n    class MySQL {\n        &lt;&lt;database&gt;&gt;\n    }\n    class LocalDatabase {\n        &lt;&lt;SQLite&gt;&gt;\n        +enqueue()\n        +cache()\n        +saveDrivingLog()\n    }\n    class OnDeviceAI {\n        &lt;&lt;mobile AI&gt;&gt;\n        +drowsinessInference()\n        +documentOCR()\n    }\n    class PythonAIService {\n        &lt;&lt;optional server AI&gt;&gt;\n        +classifyIntent()\n        +chat()\n        +ocrDrivingLog()\n    }\n    class RoutingProvider {\n        &lt;&lt;external/provider&gt;&gt;\n        +autocomplete()\n        +route()\n    }\n    class RealtimeBroker {\n        &lt;&lt;STOMP/WebSocket&gt;&gt;\n        +publish()\n        +subscribe()\n    }\n\n    DriverActor --&gt; FlutterPresentation\n    ManagerActor --&gt; NextJsPresentation\n    FlutterPresentation --&gt; ApiClient\n    FlutterPresentation --&gt; LocalDatabase\n    FlutterPresentation --&gt; OnDeviceAI\n    NextJsPresentation --&gt; SafeFleetApi\n    SafeFleetApi --&gt; SpringControllers\n    ApiClient --&gt; SpringControllers\n    SpringControllers --&gt; DomainServices\n    DomainServices --&gt; JpaRepositories\n    DomainServices --&gt; DomainEntities\n    JpaRepositories --&gt; MySQL\n    DomainServices --&gt; PythonAIService\n    DomainServices --&gt; RoutingProvider\n    DomainServices --&gt; RealtimeBroker\n    RealtimeBroker --&gt; NextJsPresentation&quot;,
  &quot;config&quot;: null
